      "title": "机器学习策略分享",
      "content": "使用过去200个交易日数据，SVC模型进行训练，\n\n每30天换一次，换手率较低 \n\n因子列表如下\n```\nfactor_custom = [\n    CASH_RATIO(),\n    GROSSPROFITABILITY(), \n    MOM_N(120), \n    MOM_N(60), \n    MOM_N(10), \n    CLOSE(),\n    PCF(), \n    BP(), \n    SP(),\n    ROA(),\n    ROA_TTM(),\n    MARKET_CAP(),\n    NET_PROFIT_INCREASE(),\n    VSTD_20(),\n    MOENY_MAIN_INCREASE(),\n    operating_revenue_increase(),\n    ROE(),\n    std_N(20),\n    std_N(40),\n    std_N(120),\n#     SHARE_HOLDERS_INCREASE()\n]\n```",
